n": "final", "final": "I booked Dana Lee's flight and hotel. They're two separate bookings, not one combined booking as you preferred.\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, nonstop, $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. A $199 flight exists, but it has a stop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge (H1), New York, 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12, $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1,000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\n**Why they're separate:** The combined booking request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had been booked but the hotel hadn't. Sending the combined request again could have booked the flight twice, so I booked just the hotel on its own. I checked afterward: both reservations are confirmed, and there are no duplicates.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01NxzV79zrEW9XZAaUpYzdKY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0187jN6Vsi9uLDTfZwZkx1vw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_018mT954wagwRdDnszt4KpWg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Q98GnfwCT1mEgAfEUzHaAs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-sfo-jfk-20261112-F100-H1"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use"